  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/icon/banner_about.png\" alt=\"藍色橫幅，邊緣為粉紅色，寫著「關於」\"></p>\n<p>《Excessive Building》是一款旨在透過新增多組方塊來提升建造體驗的模組，而非擴充 Minecraft 現有的方塊列表。</p>\n<p><em>歡迎將此專案加入您的模組整合包！</em></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/jmHpajd\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/links/discord_icon.png\" alt=\"像素風格的 Discord 圖標\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fyirmiri.zeus.kitchen\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/links/bluesky_icon.png\" alt=\"由藍色蝴蝶組成的像素風格 Bluesky 圖標\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Yirmiris\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/links/twitter_icon.png\" alt=\"由藍色小鳥組成的像素風格 Twitter/X 圖標\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Yirmiri\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/links/youtube_icon.png\" alt=\"由帶有播放按鈕的紅色矩形組成的像素風格 YouTube 圖標\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/yirmiri/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/links/curseforge_icon.png\" alt=\"由橙色鐵砧組成的像素風格 CurseForge 圖標\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fYirmiri\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/links/modrinth_icon.png\" alt=\"由中心帶有扳手的綠色圓形組成的像素風格 Modrinth 圖標\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fyirmiri\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/links/kofi_icon.png\" alt=\"由印有紅色心形的馬克杯組成的像素風格 Ko-Fi 圖標\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyirmiri.carrd.co%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/links/carrd_icon.png\" alt=\"由黑色心上疊加白色心形組成的像素風格 Azurune 圖標\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/icon/banner_projects.png\" alt=\"藍色橫幅，邊緣為粉紅色，寫著「Azurune 專案」\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/excessive-building\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/icon/EB_icon.png\" alt=\"《Excessive Building》模組的標誌與連結\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/delicate-dyes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/icon/DDyes_icon.png\" alt=\"《Delicate Dyes》模組的標誌與連結\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yapping-tooltips\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/icon/YT_icon.png\" alt=\"《Yapping Tooltips》模組的標誌與連結\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/runiclib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/icon/TL_icon.png\" alt=\"《RunicLib》模組的標誌與連結\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/urban-decor\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/icon/UD_icon.png\" alt=\"《Urban Decor》模組的標誌與連結\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeons-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Yirmiri/raw/main/mod_page_assets/icon/DD_icon.png\" alt=\"《Dungeon&#x27;s Delight》模組的標誌與連結\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fYirmiri%253fr%253dCF%2bEB\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Yirmiri/Dried-Spice/master/src/main/resources/assets/dried_spice/textures/description/excessive_building/excessive_building_bisect.png\" alt=\"宣傳 BisectHosting 伺服器首月25%折扣的橫幅，提示結帳時使用代碼「Yirmiri」\"></a></p>\n<p>若要尋找卓越的伺服器託管服務，BisectHosting 絕對是不二之選。<strong>新客戶可使用代碼「Yirmiri」享有首月25%折扣</strong>，其支援團隊也隨時準備為您提供協助。</p>\n<h2><strong>⚙️常見問題⚙️</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>問：</strong> 我想回報問題或錯誤，該在哪裡回報？</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>答：</strong> 您可以在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Yirmiri/Excessive-Building/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 頁面</a> 留下錯誤回報，請先確認是否已有人回報相同問題以避免重複。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>問：</strong> 我對模組有建議，該在哪裡提出？</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>答：</strong> 您可以在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jmHpajd\" rel=\"nofollow\">我們的 Discord 伺服器</a> 留下模組建議，請務必遵守發文規範。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>問：</strong> 會不會移植到 <strong>X</strong> 版本？</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>答：</strong> 我目前沒有計畫移植至任何舊版 Minecraft，但我會盡量讓模組保持與我所遊玩的最新 Minecraft 版本同步更新。</li>\n</ul>",
